    "{0} The refractometer leans {1}: {2} here against {3}% for the recipe, where {4} aims for {5}. If you cannot taste a difference, keep {6}.": "{0} El refractómetro se inclina {1}: {2} aquí contra {3}% de la receta, donde {4} apunta a {5}. Si no notas la diferencia, quédate con {6}.",
