    "<button type=\"button\" class=\"tip-act\" data-act=\"window\" data-secs=\"{0}\">Move the window onto this shot</button>": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"tip-act\" data-act=\"window\" data-secs=\"{0}\">Mueve la ventana a esta extracción</button>",
